[69.656962, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[38;5;105m\u001b[1mapp/money.py\u001b[22m\u001b[39m: Updated \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m to use half-up rounding\u001b[64Gvia\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BPython's\u001b[15G\u001b[38;5;105mDecimal\u001b[23G\u001b[39mmodule\u001b[30Gwith\u001b[35G\u001b[38;5;105mROUND_HALF_UP\u001b[39m.\u001b[50GNow\u001b[54G7350\u001b[59G÷\u001b[61G100\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gcorrectly rounds to 74 (not 73), and\u001b[43G7% tax on 1050 cents\u001b[64Gis\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bproperly\u001b[15Gcalculated as 74 cents.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;105m\u001b[1mapp/split.py\u001b[22m\u001b[39m: Changed \u001b[38;5;105msplit_bill()\u001b[39m to use fl\u001b[51Gor division (\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdirect\u001b[15Ginstead of\u001b[26Gcalling \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m.\u001b[47GBill\u001b[52Gsplitting\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66Gtax\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gcalculations need different rounding strategies—spl\u001b[58Gtti\u001b[62Gg uses\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfloor div\u001b[16Gsion with\u001b[26Gthe first person absorbing lef\u001b[57Gover\u001b[62Gcents.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAll 9 tests pass,\u001b[21Gincluding the three money tests\u001b[53Gtha\u001b[57G w\u001b[61Ge failing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbefore.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B●\u001b[3GRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m stop\u001b[14Ghook\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m⎿  \u001b[39mStop\u001b[11Ghook\u001b[16Gerror:\u001b[23G✗\u001b[25GNonna:\u001b[32Gwhere's\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gtest?\u001b[50G(stop:\u001b[57Gcode\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gchanged, no test\u001b[20Gchanged)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAdd a test that fails\u001b[25Gwithout your change and pa\u001b[52Gses with\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit, or tell\u001b[16Ghe user plainly\u001b[32Gwhy\u001b[36Gthis\u001b[41Gchange\u001b[48Gneeds\u001b[54Gnone.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[